## Report Structure

```
reports/
└── YYYY-MM-DD/
    └── <spoke-cluster>/
        ├── <report-name>.md          # Main report (Markdown)
        ├── report-index.json         # Index metadata (version, arch, status)
        ├── oslat/                    # OSLAT test artifacts
        ├── ptp/                      # PTP test artifacts
        ├── cyclictest/               # Cyclictest artifacts
        ├── cpu-util/                 # CPU utilization artifacts
        ├── reboot/                   # Reboot test artifacts
        ├── rfc2544/                  # RFC2544 network test artifacts
        ├── rds-compare/              # RDS compare artifacts
        └── node-info-<spoke>.json    # Hardware metadata
```

